  "pointer_derivation": [
    "4CB229 before ADD ESP28h: EDX=(S-28h)+44h=S+1Ch, address of format array.",
    "4CB22D restores ESP=S;4CB232 EBX=S+38h, address of first statistic value.",
    "4CB236 stores format-array cursor atS+18h.",
    "After two6-argument number calls, ESP=S-30h.4CB282 [ESP+48h] therefore loads cursor fromS+18h.",
    "4CB28A EAX=[EBX] loads statistic.4CB28D EBP=[EDX] loads format pointer.",
    "First formatted PUSH order at4CB28C/295/2A6/2A7/2A8/2A9/2AB is color,font,x,y,format,40h,value. Reverse order gives[value,40h,format,y,x,font,color].",
    "4CB2B1 fetches shadow from(S-4Ch)+60h=S+14h;4CB2BB cleans4Ch bytes, restoring ESP=S.",
    "Second PUSH at4CB2C2/2C8/2CE/2CF/2D2/2D3/2D5 is shadow,font,x,y,format,40h,value.4CB2D0 reloads value fromEBX; EBP still holds format.",
    "4CB2DB/2E5/2E8/2EE increment the format cursor by4 and EBX by8 each row; ESI increments14."
  ],
